USAGE
  makeprofiledb [-h] [-help] -in in_pssm_list [-binary]
    [-title database_title] [-threshold word_score_threshold] [-force]
    [-out database_name] [-blastdb_version version]
    [-max_smp_vol max_smp_files_per_vol] [-dbtype output_db_type]
    [-index create_index_files] [-gapopen gap_open_penalty]
    [-gapextend gap_extend_penalty] [-scale pssm_scale_factor]
    [-matrix matrix_name] [-obsr_threshold observations_threshold]
    [-exclude_invalid exclude_invalid] [-taxid TaxID]
    [-taxid_map TaxIDMapFile] [-logfile File_Name] [-version]

DESCRIPTION
   Application to create databases for rpsblast, cobalt and deltablast,
   version 2.17.0+

REQUIRED ARGUMENTS
 -in <File_In>
   Input file that contains a list of smp files (delimited by space, tab or
   newline)

OPTIONAL ARGUMENTS
 -h
   Print USAGE and DESCRIPTION;  ignore all other parameters
 -help
   Print USAGE, DESCRIPTION and ARGUMENTS; ignore all other parameters
 -version
   Print version number;  ignore other arguments

 *** Input options
 -binary
   Scoremats are in binary format

 *** Configuration options
 -title <String>
   Title for database
   Default = input file name provided to -in argument
 -threshold <Real>
   Minimum word score to add a word to the lookup table
   Default = `9.82'
 -force
   Use cmdline threshold

 *** Output options
 -out <String>
   Name of database to be created
   Default = input file name provided to -in argument
 -blastdb_version <Integer, 4..5>
   Version of BLAST database to be created
   Default = `5'
 -max_smp_vol <Integer>
   Maximum number of SMP files per DB volume
   Default = `2500'
 -dbtype <String, `cobalt', `delta', `rps'>
   Output database type: cobalt, delta, rps
   Default = `rps'
 -index <Boolean>
   Create Index Files
   Default = `true'

 *** Used only if scoremat files do not contain PSSM scores, ignored
 *** otherwise.
 -gapopen <Integer>
   Cost to open a gap
 -gapextend <Integer>
   Cost to extend a gap, 
 -scale <Real>
   Pssm Scale factor 
   Default = `100'
 -matrix <String, `BLOSUM45', `BLOSUM50', `BLOSUM62', `BLOSUM80', `BLOSUM90',
                  `PAM250', `PAM30', `PAM70'>
   Scoring matrix name
   Default = `BLOSUM62'

 *** Delta Blast Options
 -obsr_threshold <Real>
   Exclude domains with with maximum number of independent observations below
   this threshold
   Default = `6'
 -exclude_invalid <Boolean>
   Exclude domains that do not pass validation test
   Default = `true'

 *** Taxonomy options
 -taxid <Integer, >=0>
   Taxonomy ID to assign to all sequences
    * Incompatible with:  taxid_map
 -taxid_map <File_In>
   Text file mapping sequence IDs to taxonomy IDs.
   Format:<SequenceId> <TaxonomyId><newline>
    * Incompatible with:  taxid
 -logfile <File_Out>
   File to which the program log should be redirected

